Subject: [Krypton] Migrate generated profile names alongside visible branding

The product strings are rebuilt, but profile names are copied to both profile
preferences and the Local State profile-picker cache. Translate only names
explicitly marked browser-generated, preserving custom names, managed prefs
and enterprise/account labels. Apply profile-pref migration before name
observers are installed so the old pref cannot overwrite the updated cache.
Use the existing Windows shortcut manager to refresh only already generated
profile shortcuts whose recorded name matches the migration; never create new
shortcuts or rename arbitrary files. All disk writes use the existing browser
preference/shortcut services. Upstream identifiers and profile paths stay intact.

